# Wrong parts. A 40 mm part expected, the 30 mm one gripped: WRONG at the
# contact, off_reason 8, the model never takes a payload. Then the right
# width but 4.5 kg expected (2 kg gripped): the model takes 4.5 kg, the lift
# measures ~2.8: mismatch (tolerance 1 kg), off_reason 6 - before the 2.5 kg
# error trips the collision detector.
@program arm/arm_sim
@args arm/arcmate/arcmate_gripper.arm
@include arm/tests/inc_grip_pick.txt
grip expect 40 2.0 0 0 0.15
grip close
run 1.5
print grip off
grip open
lcnc 0
run 2.5
lcnc 1
run 0.5
mark
grip expect 30 4.5 0 0 0.15
grip close
run 1.5
tlmove 1.0 799.3 0 1370.9 0 0 0
run 1.2
print grip off coll
@expect arm.grip_state[1] == 3
@expect arm.pay_model[1] == 0
@expect arm.off_reason[1] == 8
@expect arm.pay_state[2] == 4
@expect arm.pay_meas[2] < 3.3
@expect arm.off_reason[2] == 6
@expect arm.coll[-1] == 0
@reject ^ERROR
